{%- comment -%}
  Login-required guard

  Redirects logged-out visitors away from collection, product and page
  (/pages/*) URLs to the home page. Rendered in <head> from layout/theme.liquid.

  The password-gate entry page (/pages/akima-store, the 'gate' template) is
  never guarded — logged-out visitors must reach it to enter the password and
  unlock the gate. It is matched both by handle and by template suffix so a
  renamed handle still can't lock people out of the gate.

  Who is allowed through:
    - Logged-in customers: never guarded (the render below is skipped server-side
      when `customer` is present).
    - Password-gate visitors: anyone who unlocked the Akima Store gate this
      session has sessionStorage 'akima-store-gate' = 'granted' (set by
      sections/password-gate.liquid). They browse the gated collection AND its
      product pages while logged OUT, so the JS below lets them through on any
      guarded page — matching how snippets/akima-store-mode.liquid already
      applies akima-store-mode site-wide for these visitors.
    - Everyone else who is logged out: redirected to routes.root_url (home).

  Not rendered on the gated collection template (`template.suffix == 'gated'`):
  that page keeps its own snippets/collection-gate-guard.liquid, which redirects
  non-unlocked visitors to the password page instead of home. Excluding it here
  avoids two guards racing to redirect to different places.

  Client-side redirect (Shopify Liquid has no server-side {% redirect %} in
  themes), so we hide <body> until the decision is made to avoid a flash of the
  protected page. Mirrors the pattern in snippets/collection-gate-guard.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if customer == blank -%}
  {%- assign guard_this_page = false -%}

  {%- if request.page_type == 'collection' or request.page_type == 'product' -%}
    {%- comment -%} The gated Akima collection keeps its own collection-gate-guard. {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- unless template.name == 'collection' and template.suffix == 'gated' -%}
      {%- assign guard_this_page = true -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
  {%- elsif request.page_type == 'page' -%}
    {%- comment -%} Guard all /pages/* except the password-gate entry page. {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- unless page.handle == 'akima-store' or template.suffix == 'gate' -%}
      {%- assign guard_this_page = true -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if guard_this_page -%}
      <style id="LoginGuardHide">body { visibility: hidden !important; }</style>
      <noscript><style>body { visibility: visible !important; }</style></noscript>
      <script>
        (function () {
          var HOME = {{ routes.root_url | json }};
          var granted = false;
          try { granted = sessionStorage.getItem('akima-store-gate') === 'granted'; } catch (e) {}

          if (granted) {
            var hide = document.getElementById('LoginGuardHide');
            if (hide && hide.parentNode) hide.parentNode.removeChild(hide);
          } else {
            window.location.replace(HOME);
          }
        })();
      </script>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
